<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse closed for Chakri Day.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse closed for Chakri Day.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai stock exchange was closed on Monday on an official substitute holiday to mark the Chakri Day in honour of the founder of Thailand's reigning royal dynasty.</p>
<p>The bourse will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The composite SET Index gained 8.08 points to close at 714.09 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
